    <string name="setup_title">Your apps. One screen.</string>
    <string name="setup_body">Car Assistant V10 splits Android Auto into 2–3 panels, each running a real Android app.\n\nRequirements:\n• Root access (su)\n• LSPosed module enabled for “Android Auto” and “System Framework”\n\nTap Start, then pick an app for each panel from the ⋮ menu.</string>
