    <string name="guide_step1">1. Enable Car Assistant V10 module in LSPosed (scope System Framework and Android Auto).</string>
    <string name="guide_step2">2. Grant permanent root (su) access in Magisk, KernelSU, or APatch.</string>
    <string name="guide_step3">3. Connect phone to car. Open Car Assistant V10 on the car display.</string>
    <string name="guide_step4">4. On the car, drag the center divider to adjust panel sizes directly.</string>

